Subject: [PATCH 1514/3799] soh: rename func_80B9ACE4 -> ObjMure3_DespawnRupees

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: kills every rupee that is still lying around when the player leaves, recording the ones already collected so they are not respawned.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Mure3/z_obj_mure3.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Mure3/z_obj_mure3.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Mure3/z_obj_mure3.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Mure3/z_obj_mure3.c
